# ❤️ Kernel Ring Buffer

The kernel stores recent messages in a temporary in-memory structure called the **kernel ring buffer**.

## Characteristics
- Stored in RAM
- Circular buffer
- Older messages are overwritten
- Contains most recent kernel events

